1
00:00:00,824 --> 00:00:02,074
SHELDON:
A word of warning:

2
00:00:02,242 --> 00:00:04,122
(Sheldon:)My guest is a noted physicist...

3
00:00:04,286 --> 00:00:06,616
(Sheldon:)...and the leading expert
on quantum cosmology...

4
00:00:06,788 --> 00:00:10,998
(Sheldon:)...so please try to avoid wasting her time
with female gibber-gabber.

5
00:00:11,835 --> 00:00:13,005
Female gibber-gabber?

6
00:00:13,169 --> 00:00:15,879
(Sheldon:)Shoe sales, hair styles, mud masks...

7
00:00:16,047 --> 00:00:19,887
(Sheldon:)...gossip about your friends,
Brad and Angelina.

8
00:00:21,094 --> 00:00:22,474
PENNY:
No, they're not my friends.

9
00:00:22,637 --> 00:00:26,767
SHELDON: Not surprised, considering how
you talk about them behind their backs.

10
00:00:29,269 --> 00:00:30,309
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

11
00:00:30,478 --> 00:00:33,268
(Leonard:)She's here. She's here.
How do I look? Do I look smart?

12
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:37,740
(Sheldon:)Oh, good grief. This isn't about you.

13
00:00:37,944 --> 00:00:38,984
(Sheldon:)Coming.

14
00:00:39,154 --> 00:00:42,114
(Sheldon:)Now, listen, one of the great minds
of the 21st century...

15
00:00:42,282 --> 00:00:46,582
(Sheldon:)...is about to play host to one of the
other great minds of the 21st century.

16
00:00:47,662 --> 00:00:48,742
(Sheldon:)So pay attention.

17
00:00:48,913 --> 00:00:52,793
(Sheldon:)Years from now, my biographer
might ask you about this event.

18
00:00:53,668 --> 00:00:56,798
Well, I have so many things
to tell your biographer.

19
00:00:57,589 --> 00:00:59,339
Oh, Dr. Cooper, thank goodness.

20
00:00:59,507 --> 00:01:01,137
(Elizabeth:)I completely forgot your address.

